  "question": {
    "text": "Each of <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi></math> tosses a fair coin simultaneously <math><mn>10</mn></math> times. The probability that both of them will not get tail at the same toss is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "For any toss, total cases: <math><mi>H</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>H</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>T</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi></math> ( <math><mn>4</mn></math> cases)<br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> both of them will not get tail at same toss, then the favorable cases: <math><mi>H</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>H</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>T</mi><mi>H</mi></math> ( <math><mn>3</mn></math> cases)<br />Hence, the required probability <math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
  }
